*.pem

# Finder/iCloud duplicate copies — "sw 2.js", "index.d 3.ts", "index.pack 10.pack".
# Two of these had been committed and were precached by the service worker,
# and stray copies under .next/types made tsc report duplicate identifiers.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*

